<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $1.00 higher than Tuesday's close. Demand good and Supply moderate. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    55.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    52.50-55.50</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows steady to 1.00 higher. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    47.00-52.00</p>
</text>
